    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Hesai Group is a public company headquartered in Shanghai, trading under the ticker HSAI with SEC CIK 0001861737. Its website presents the company as Hesai Technology and describes it as a global leader in 3D perception and lidar solutions for ADAS and autonomous mobility.\n\nThe company says its lidar sensors support physical AI across ADAS, autonomous mobility, robotics, and spatial intelligence. It states that it partners with automotive OEMs, autonomous vehicle, and robotics companies worldwide, and that it delivers mass-produced lidars to customers in over 40 countries. The site describes lidars as providing high-resolution 3D perception for features such as AEB and NOA, and says Hesai provides sensors meeting standards for L4+ autonomous driving for robotaxis and robobuses.\n\nNo litigation is recorded in the available facts, and no specific product models are listed beyond the general lidar sensor categories described on the site.",
